category: Science
requires: cygwin libblosc1 libgcc1 libgomp1 libhdf5_320 libstdc++6
sdesc: "High-throughput compression of FASTQ data (runtime)"
ldesc: "SeqDB is a file format, compressor and storage tool for the raw data produced
by Next-Generation Sequencing platforms like the Illumina HiSeq 2000 and MiSeq
and the Life Technologies Ion Torrent PGM."
external-source: seqdb

